  "body": "Renovated 3-bedroom brick and tile home with stunning sea views in the heart of Manly.\r\n\r\nAs you step through the front door you are greeted by a stylish open plan living space with spectacular views, adorned with tasteful finishes, and flooded with natural light. The thoughtfully designed interior boasts a contemporary kitchen with modern appliances.\r\n\r\nEach spacious bedroom has its own unique aspect, and the main bedroom enjoys its own private deck.\r\n\r\nInternal access to large garage keeps you dry on the rainy days.\r\n\r\nThis charming house is centrally located and is within walking distance to the Coast Plaza, Whangaparaoa Primary and Whangaparaoa College.\r\nGetting to Big Manly beach is only 2 minutes by car, 4 minutes by bicycle or a 20 minute stroll.\r\n\r\nThis home is ideal for any buyer, whether you are first home buyers, someone looking to embrace the coastal lifestyle or as an investment.  \r\n\r\nViewing by appointment and open home.\r\n\r\nPrivate sale, no agents thanks.",
